msgid "Reconnecting to the suggestions service"
msgstr "建议服务正在重新连接"

msgid "%1 quit unexpectedly"
msgstr "%1 出现意外退出"

msgid "Reports with the same signature kept recently: %1. Agent can look into the cause; the root cause isn't known yet."
msgstr "最近保留了 %1 份相同签名的报告。可以让 Agent 检查原因，尚未确定根因。"

msgid "The crash reports folder can't be read right now."
